{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple Roguelike Deckbuilder inspired by other genre games designed for faster runs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic approach based on Artefact system and upgrading cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combination of Active and Passive Artefacts to get out of various situations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/Artefacts.gif?t=1746058010\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/Tocka.gif?t=1746058010\" />Wheel of Fortune System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin for Gold, HP or Random Artefact you own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most rewards are positive with exception of Curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No option to decline won Cards and Artefacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Possible to win less coins than invested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First spin at each event upgrades next Wheel quality until epic, then resets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple consecutive events possible for quick progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Node Map System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random Generated Map featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elite Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop (with refresh option)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wheel of Fortune events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playable Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Archer: Aggressive character, Can s